T1  - Transforming Surgical Training With AI Techniques for Training, Assessment, and Evaluation: Scoping Review
AU  - Escobar-Castillejos, David
AU  - Barrera-Animas, Ari Y
AU  - Noguez, Julieta
AU  - Magana, Alejandra J
